			"widgets_values":[
				"**图片生成提示词：**\n\n\"Create an image with a 9:16 aspect ratio: a composition featuring 8 continuous frames arranged in a 2x2 grid layout that showcases an American woman with golden blonde hair, demonstrating and explaining the usage of a sleek, modern hairdryer (similar to the one in the reference image). The environment is a well-lit, minimalistic bathroom with soft, natural lighting and a clean, polished aesthetic. Ensure the visuals follow a warm, inviting color palette with metallic tones and whites, emphasizing the premium feel of the hairdryer. The sequence should include:\n\n1. **Frame 1 (Wide shot)**: The woman standing in the bathroom, holding the hairdryer and smiling confidently, with the bathroom's clean and modern decor visible in the background.  \n   - Scene details: Marble countertops, a round mirror, and soft warm lighting.  \n   - Camera angle: Slightly high-angle wide shot.  \n\n2. **Frame 2 (Medium shot)**: The woman gesturing to the hairdryer in her hand, highlighting its sleek design and features, while speaking directly to the camera.  \n   - Scene details: Focus on the hairdryer, showing its metallic finish and ergonomic design.  \n   - Camera angle: Eye level, medium shot.  \n\n3. **Frame 3 (Close-up)**: A detailed view of the hairdryer's nozzle and buttons, with the woman's hand gently adjusting the settings.  \n   - Scene details: Showcase the hairdryer's texture and buttons clearly.  \n   - Camera angle: Close-up, slightly angled to emphasize the design.  \n\n4. **Frame 4 (Medium shot)**: The woman turning on the hairdryer, with her hair gently blowing in the airflow.  \n   - Scene details: Soft movement of her golden hair, glowing under warm light.  \n   - Camera angle: Eye level, medium shot with slight side profile.  \n\n5. **Frame 5 (Close-up)**: A focused shot of the air flowing from the hairdryer, showing its powerful yet smooth flow.  \n   - Scene details: Highlight the air movement visually, possibly with strands of hair in motion.  \n   - Camera angle: Close-up, focusing on the nozzle and airflow.  \n\n6. **Frame 6 (Medium shot)**: The woman using the hairdryer to style her hair, looking at herself in the mirror with a satisfied expression.  \n   - Scene details: Reflection in the mirror showing her styling technique and glowing skin.  \n   - Camera angle: Over-the-shoulder shot, capturing both her and the mirror.  \n\n7. **Frame 7 (Close-up)**: A detailed view of the styled hair, showcasing its smooth texture and shine.  \n   - Scene details: Golden locks cascading down, reflecting soft light.  \n   - Camera angle: Close-up, focusing on the hair's texture.  \n\n8. **Frame 8 (Medium shot)**: The woman smiling confidently at the camera, holding the hairdryer and giving a thumbs up.  \n   - Scene details: Background visible with bathroom decor, emphasizing the product's premium quality.  \n   - Camera angle: Eye level, medium shot.  \n\nEnsure seamless transitions between frames, maintaining a cohesive storytelling flow with consistent lighting and color tones. Use a warm, inviting atmosphere to highlight the product's high-end features and the woman's professional, approachable demeanor.\""
